        <properties isSpecification="false" sType="Class" nType="0" scope="public" stereotype="ResourceArtifact" documentation="Versioned, security-gated external contract (v1: snapshot, event stream, detection submit, plan decision) so remote desktops, peer C2 systems, analytics tools, or enterprise data services can integrate with a service node. Transport-neutral types here; the HTTP/JSON + WebSocket transport is the next stack addition. docs/gungnir-capabilities.md §5.5 -- High."/>
